@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/odp#>.

:Ontology a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "kHealth-Asthma Ontology" ;
    rdfs:comment "An ontology for the kHealth-Asthma project, modeling asthma patients, symptoms, medications, and environmental factors.".

:Patient a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Patient" ;
    rdfs:comment "A person suffering from asthma.".

:Symptom a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Symptom" ;
    rdfs:comment "A health condition experienced by a patient.".

:Medication a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Medication" ;
    rdfs:comment "A drug used to treat asthma symptoms.".

:Environment a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Environment" ;
    rdfs:comment "The outdoor environment where the patient is located.".

:Allergen a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Allergen" ;
    rdfs:comment "An outdoor environmental factor that triggers asthma symptoms.".

:Pollen a :Allergen ;
    rdfs:label "Pollen" ;
    rdfs:comment "Outdoor environmental allergen, such as pollen.".

:AQI a :Allergen ;
    rdfs:label "Air Quality Index" ;
    rdfs:comment "Outdoor environmental allergen, such as air quality index.".

:CausalRelation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ a :Patient ; owl:oneOf ( :Patient :Allergen ) ] ;
    rdfs:range :CausalEffect ;
    rdfs:label "Causal Relation" ;
    rdfs:comment "Represents the causal relation between a patient and an allergen.".

:CausalEffect a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Causal Effect" ;
    rdfs:comment "Represents the effect of an allergen on a patient.".

:EffectOnSymptom a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ a :CausalEffect ; owl:oneOf ( :Symptom :Medication ) ] ;
    rdfs:range xsd:float ;
    rdfs:label "Effect on Symptom" ;
    rdfs:comment "Represents the effect of a causal effect on a symptom or medication.".

:EffectOnMedication a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain [ a :CausalEffect ; owl:oneOf ( :Symptom :Medication ) ] ;
    rdfs:range xsd:float ;
    rdfs:label "Effect on Medication" ;
    rdfs:comment "Represents the effect of a causal effect on medication intake.".

Scenario-requirement-to-axiom mapping:
1. The presence of outdoor environmental allergen such as pollen or AQI causes the patient to experience symptoms and/or medication intake: :CausalRelation, :EffectOnSymptom, :EffectOnMedication
2. The ontology structurally supports the scenario by defining classes and properties for patients, symptoms, medications, environments, allergens, causal relations, causal effects, and effects on symptoms and medications.